# Commit identity (ProofReel Action)

This repository is a public brand surface for ProofReel. Git history must reflect the project owner only.

- **Author and committer** for every commit must be: **Alcides Zelaya** `<alcideszelaya@hotmail.com>`.
- **Never** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>` (or any Cursor Agent co-author line).
- **Never** add `Made-with: Cursor` (or similar) trailers to commit messages.

When committing from Cursor Cloud Agents or other automation, rewrite authorship to the identity above before push, and keep messages free of Cursor attribution trailers.

Install repo hooks once per clone: `./scripts/setup-git-hooks.sh` (see `CONTRIBUTING.md`).
